        "content": "this means the token limit has been set so that the output is equivalent to 16k, max_tokens represents output amount.\r\nSo requesting a 16k output including a ``768`` in actual message context, so in total you are requesting ``17152`` which is above the maximum for that model.\r\ndrop the token limit to half or 2/3",
